OL,3,AAbramovich's close associate misled UK
OL,4,Acourt in #1bn oil-fields case,
OL,5,Adocuments suggest
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of Roman Abramovich's closest
OL,8,Fassociates misled a UK court to help
OL,9,Fsecure ownership of Siberian oil
OL,10,Ffields, leaked documents seen by the
OL,11,FBBC suggest.
OL,13,FEugene Tenenbaum, a former director of
OL,14,FChelsea Football Club, helped to manage
OL,15,Fthe billionaire's wealth at the time of
OL,16,Fthe case in 2008, which Abramovich won.
