OL,3,AAbramovich's close associate misled UK
OL,4,Acourt in #1bn oil-fields case,
OL,5,Adocuments suggest
OL,6,
OL,7,FTenenbaum was giving evidence during
OL,8,Fproceedings taken against Abramovich by
OL,9,Fa company owned by another Russian
OL,10,Fbillionaire, who was claiming the oil
OL,11,Ffields had been stolen from him and
OL,12,Fother investors.
OL,14,FThe leaked documents now suggest there
OL,15,Fwas a premeditated attempt by
OL,16,FAbramovich to reduce the value of the
OL,17,Fother investors' stake in the Siberian
OL,18,Fventure.
